    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come out~ Push out your ultimate golden 6-star mutant Pupu! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist casual game, the gameplay is as follows: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Players need to place coins and then push the coins down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. After the coin is pushed down, it will randomly trigger the doll release event, and the doll has a certain probability of falling on the coin pusher. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Touching the color area will color the doll, and then star the doll according to the number of consecutive lights.</p>",
